{"id":"c7cf057d5daacec1","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code.md","title":"ZFC Set12 Kuratowski Pair Code","display":"df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code — ZFC Set12 Kuratowski Pair Code","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code"],"display":"df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code — ZFC Set12 Kuratowski Pair Code","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-set12-singleton-operator]]","[[58-df-zfc-set12-unordered-pair-operator]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code — ZFC Set12 Kuratowski Pair Code"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"73a0b5ce48eae7b9\" href=\"?note=73a0b5ce48eae7b9\" title=\"58-df-zfc-set12-singleton-operator\">58-df-zfc-set12-singleton-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"55d2e5aa428201e3\" href=\"?note=55d2e5aa428201e3\" title=\"58-df-zfc-set12-unordered-pair-operator\">58-df-zfc-set12-unordered-pair-operator</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,x,y\">\\(p,x,y\\)</span> (set parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet12SingletonOperator}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet12SingletonOperator}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet12UnorderedPairOperator}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet12UnorderedPairOperator}_S\\)</span> are the canonical pairing predicates</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet12KuratowskiPairCode}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet12KuratowskiPairCode}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set12\\text{-}kuratowski\\text{-}pair\\text{-}code} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet12KuratowskiPairCode}_S(p,x,y)\\leftrightarrow \\exists s,u\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcSet12SingletonOperator}_S(s,x)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcSet12UnorderedPairOperator}_S(u,x,y)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcSet12UnorderedPairOperator}_S(p,s,u))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set12\\text{-}kuratowski\\text{-}pair\\text{-}code} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet12KuratowskiPairCode}_S(p,x,y)\\leftrightarrow \\exists s,u\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcSet12SingletonOperator}_S(s,x)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcSet12UnorderedPairOperator}_S(u,x,y)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcSet12UnorderedPairOperator}_S(p,s,u))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ordered pair code definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-set12-singleton-operator","status":"resolved","id":"73a0b5ce48eae7b9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-set12-singleton-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-set12-unordered-pair-operator","status":"resolved","id":"55d2e5aa428201e3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-set12-unordered-pair-operator]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p,x,y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet12SingletonOperator}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet12UnorderedPairOperator}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet12KuratowskiPairCode}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set12\\text{-}kuratowski\\text{-}pair\\text{-}code} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet12KuratowskiPairCode}_S(p,x,y)\\leftrightarrow \\exists s,u\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcSet12SingletonOperator}_S(s,x)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcSet12UnorderedPairOperator}_S(u,x,y)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcSet12UnorderedPairOperator}_S(p,s,u))","display":true}],"bytes":1039,"backlinks":[{"id":"4afc8517bfa0c07e","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcSet12KuratowskiPairCode}_S$ (ordered-pair predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code]])"},{"id":"599d16bb1d9ed41c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcSet12KuratowskiPairCode}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch19/58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code.md]])."},{"id":"a2160ec9261f8f3b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"925588f7d7cb9abb","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcSet12KuratowskiPairCode}_S$（Kuratowski 有序对编码，见 [[../batch19/58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code.md]]）"},{"id":"2d1b22f1af825e85","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcSet12KuratowskiPairCode}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (ordered-pair code, see [[../batch19/58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code.md]])"},{"id":"c5ae2b1b17a905a7","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcSet12KuratowskiPairCode}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (ordered-pair code, see [[../batch19/58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code.md]])"},{"id":"8cc82b21370b435c","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcSet12KuratowskiPairCode}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ is the ordered-pair predicate (see [[58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code]])"},{"id":"2558e7207bb97214","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm